# 0.5.19 IslandHomes: named island homes. One file per PROFILE key: homes/<key>.properties next to islands/ (main=..., home.<lower name>=...;
# value "islandKey|world|x|y|z|pitch|yaw|roll|name"). Every change = read, change, write (tmp + fsync + atomic rename) under the key's lock;
